    "section": "mcq",
    "question_type": "choice",
    "marks": 1.0,
    "stem": "Charles Babbage is considered as the \"father of the computer\" by some people because he",
    "diagrams": [],
    "options": {
      "A": "invented mechanical calculator Pascaline.",
      "B": "invented first re-programmable electronic computing machine.",
      "C": "built first personal computer at IBM.",
      "D": "introduced the concept of 'Input, Process and Output' used in modern computers.",
      "E": "is founder of ENIAC."
    },
    "reference_answer": "D",
    "explanation": "Babbage conceptualized the Analytical Engine featuring input, store, mill (processor), and output (the IPO architecture).",
    "metadata": {
      "subject": "ict",
      "grade": 13,
      "year": 2015,
      "medium": "english",
      "topic": "General ICT",
      "difficulty": "medium"
    }
  },
